# PatchifiedTensor

`PatchifiedTensor` = `PatchifiedTensorSpec` + batched `torch.Tensor`. Spec is `PatchLayout` × `original_channels` × `patch_size` (`P > 1`, square). Layout is a claim.

| Layout | Payload |
|---|---|
| `SPATIAL` | `(B, C_org, Y_dim, X_dim)` |
| `PATCH_GRID` | `(B, C_org·P·P, Y_patches, X_patches)` |
| `SEQUENCE` | `(B, Y_patches·X_patches, C_org·P·P)` |

- Tensor: `PatchifiedTensor.from_tensor(tensor=..., spec=...)`.
- Convert: `convert(spec=...)` for `SPATIAL` ↔ `PATCH_GRID` and both → `SEQUENCE`. Same `C_org` and `P`.
- `SEQUENCE` → grid: `unflatten(Y_patches=..., X_patches=...)` → `PATCH_GRID`. Then convert to `SPATIAL`.

```python
image = PatchifiedTensor.from_tensor(tensor=spatial, spec=spatial_spec)
grid = image.convert(spec=grid_spec)
sequence = image.convert(spec=sequence_spec)
grid = sequence.unflatten(Y_patches=y_patches, X_patches=x_patches)
```
